WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.690
Let me show you...

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.270
That miraculous world.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.650
The Embodiment of Breaking The Limits.

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.780
A Rank 13 Xyz Monster!

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.910
I-Impossible! Does such Monster really exist?!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:19.120
Here I come! My turn!

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.200
I activate the effect of Astral Force from my Graveyard!

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:28.250
I can return this card to my hand instead of conducting a draw!

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.250
That card again?!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:37.140
The highest level of Duel Monsters is 12.
 But we can't consider Rank 12 as the pinnacle because of that fact.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:41.180
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Astral Force!

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:47.980
This card can Rank-Up one to two Ranks on one Xyz Monster with the highest Rank on my field!

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:54.190
I rebuild the Overlay Network with the Rank 12 Etheric Maahes!

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:57.110
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:05.080
Endlessly surpassing our limits, continuously Ranking-Up!

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.580
This is the kind of Dueling Astral World aims for!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:12.920
Come forth, New Orders Rank 13!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:18.220
The innocent will that regulates all order,

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:22.600
aim for the higher destination and let the world return to the way it should be!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:29.440
See for yourself! This is our will! Etheric Amen!

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:37.950
So this is... a Rank 13 Xyz Monster?!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:07.710
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.760
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:18.220
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:21.770
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:26.650
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:32.990
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:36.200
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:39.080
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:43.710
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:46.790
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:55.260
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.380
Wha-What on earth is happening?!

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:19.760
The energy has already exceeded
 the limit of the device! At this rate...

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:19.420
"Inheritor of the Light!! Aspiring Emperor - Hope Roots!

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:30.060
K-Kaito-<i>sama</i>! If this continues...
we will get caught in the explosions too!

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.640
Yuma...

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.570
We will evacuate from here.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:39.690
Huh?! Then what about Yuma...? What will happen to Yuma?!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:42.490
We should believe in Yuma. Have faith in him.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.200
This can't...!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.660
A Rank 13 Xyz Monster...

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.120
Yuma, to Rank-Up is inevitable.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:56.040
No matter how hard a world
 tries to expand itself, there will be a limit.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:00.510
Inside such a limitation, the feeling of suspension and repressed thinking will spread.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.720
Eventually the whole world will begin to rust.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:08.220
In order to surpass that limit, a Rank-Up is required!

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:13.940
So what, the so-called surpassing limits... Isn't that the same thing as bringing it to 'em?!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:19.650
That's different! Only the chosen souls are able to achieve a Rank-Up.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:24.030
Then what about the souls that weren't chosen?!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:32.370
What about the ones together with Ena? Are you fine with whatever happens to those people?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.330
<i>Spending all your effort searching for elites and ditching all those who remain...!</i>

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:39.050
<i>Isn't that suggesting everyone doesn't have the same possibility from the beginning?!</i>

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:42.510
<i>I definitely won't approve of this world!</i>

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:47.760
I don't desire your approval anyway. Instead, I just want you to be informed.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:52.680
It would be too pitiful for you to die at the last moment without knowing anything.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.600
Alright! Resume the Duel!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.730
I activate Etheric Amen's effect!

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.320
When this Monster is Summoned successfully,

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:06.950
for the difference between the Ranks of one Xyz Monster on my opponent's field and this Monster,

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.370
this card will absorb the same amount of cards from my opponent's deck,

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:12.290
and attach them as Etheric Amen's Overlay Units!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:17.290
The difference of Ranks between Hope Ray Victory and Etheric Amen is eight!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:24.220
Thus, it takes away eight cards and makes them Overlay Units for Etheric Amen!

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.220
My cards...!

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:36.020
Then I activate Etheric Amen's effect again!

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:40.440
It gains Attack Power equal to the amount of Overlay Units x 100 points!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:46.360
The number of Overlay Units it has is 11, 
thus it gains 1100 Attack Points!

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:49.910
Then, according Rank-up Advantage’s effect,

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:55.910
when I Special Summon a Rank-Up Monster using Rank-up Magic, I can draw one card!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.040
Shining Draw!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.500
This will be the final attack.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.930
I attack Hope Ray Victory with Etheric Amen!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:12.390
At this moment, I activate the effect of the Continuous Spell, Rank Domination!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:16.350
The Monster with the lower Rank will lose Attack Power equal to

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:20.440
the difference of Ranks between the battling Monsters x 1000 points!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:24.320
The difference of Ranks between Etheric Amen and Hope Ray Victory is eight,

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:28.650
thus Hope Ray Victory loses 8000 Attack Points!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:32.370
Its Attack Power became zero again!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:36.830
This is the overwhelming difference between you and me after I've Ranked-Up.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.210
Farewell, Yuma.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.630
Alright, do it! Etheric Amen!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:51.220
With no cards in my hand, I'm out of options to stop his attack...!

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:58.600
Ri...Right! I activate a Trap! Purge Ray!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:04.150
By releasing one Xyz Monster I control, during the end of the turn,

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:09.780
this card lets me Special Summon an Xyz Monster with a lower Rank from my Graveyard!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:15.870
You don't know when to quit! Then I Direct Attack Yuma with Etheric Amen!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:21.170
I Special Summon Rainbow Kuriboh from my Graveyard in Defense Position!

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:22.750
What?!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:30.970
When I'm attacked directly, I can Special Summon Rainbow Kuriboh from my Graveyard!

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:39.350
Then...I shall vanquish that Monster!

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.020
Sorry, Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.700
I end my turn with that.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:00.710
Even though it was just my Defense Position Monster being destroyed... What a shock wave!

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:03.960
During the end of this turn, due to Purge Ray's effect,

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:09.670
I can Special Summon a Monster with a lower Rank than the released Monster from my Graveyard!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.880
A Special Summon at the price of lowering its Rank...?

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:19.600
In order to get back Astral, I'm willing to do anything necessary! I absolutely will <i>not</i> lose!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.560
How foolish.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.600
I activate Etheric Amen's other effect!

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:27.520
When my opponent Special Summons an Xyz Monster...

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:32.240
Etheric Amen will take cards from my opponent's deck

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:36.490
as its Overlay Units equal to the difference in Rank between this card and his!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.910
The difference between its Rank and your Monster's is nine!

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:46.540
Therefore, it absorbs nine cards from your deck and converts them as Overlay Units!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:52.300
Due to the increase of Etheric Amen's Overlay Units, it gains an additional 900 Attack Points!

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:56.180
7000 Attack Points...?!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:09:00.100
Do you get it now? You cannot defeat me.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.350
I...

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.990
Yuma!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:16.700
YUMA!

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:19.200
Astral...

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.500
I can't win...?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:29.340
You too...? You'll also lose the memories we shared together...?

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.510
Stop joking!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:34.970
Astral...

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:40.100
You used to be arrogant and demanding...always acting full of yourself...

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:46.020
But...but you know...! You've decided my destiny...my life!

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:50.980
Astral... Now you're my...my <i>everything</i>!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:58.950
That's why...I...can't lose you!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:03.160
No matter what, I can't lose you!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.370
That is...?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.370
This is...!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.380
So it's you, Astral... Did you lend me this power?

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:13.800
Here I go! All the Duels of the strongest Duelists are ordained by inevitability!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.880
Even the cards they draw are created by the Duelist!

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:19.930
Shining Draw!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:27.390
Huh?! Long ago, when Don Thousand and Astral battled...

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.040
Don't tell me...

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:05.010
I got it, Eliphas! This is the power of the bond between Astral and me!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:08.350
I activate the Rank-Down Magic, Numeron Fall!

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:15.570
This card is able to Rank-Down Aspiring Emperor - Hope and Special Summon a new Hope!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.780
Rank-Down again, you say?!

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:22.110
I rebuild the Overlay Network with Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.490
Xyz Change!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:34.210
Come forth, Rank One Number 39!

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.380
The Light of Hope, now marching bravely towards evolution!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:44.680
Release the memory from origin, the force of perfection!

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.510
King of Wishes - Hope Roots!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:54.810
Huh?! Don't tell me...that lord is...?!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:12:01.490
How foolish. I thought that light just now would trigger something.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.950
I activate Etheric Amen's effect!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:09.750
Cards will be absorbed from your deck equal to the Rank difference between Etheric Amen and your Monster,

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.620
and they become Etheric Amen's Overlay Units!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:20.420
The difference between Ranks is 12! Therefore, 12 additional Overlay Units can be added!

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:27.050
And Etheric Amen gains an additional 1200 Attack Points!

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:31.230
Now the remaining number of cards in your deck is zero, and your hand is also at zero!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:34.520
That Shining Draw you worked so hard for seems to have gone to waste.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.940
No, It hasn't gone to waste.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.690
What did you say?

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:43.780
Although you said in order to surpass the world's limits, Ranking-Up is crucial, that's not the case!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:48.160
If a Rank-Up is necessary, it should be for those still living!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.250
Astral is completely different compared to someone like you!

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.540
That guy...no...not only him.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:58.210
Kaito and Shark too, and all the friends I encountered in my Duels...

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:04.720
Everyone has their own problems, and were desperately fighting for themselves!

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:10.390
<i>Isn't everyone having conflict between the good will and evil deeds deep inside their hearts?</i>

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:15.390
<i>But as long as you're courageous enough to accept this truth, there will be a second chance no matter what!</i>

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.230
<i>Anyone can come to understand each other!</i>

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:24.950
<i>People ignoring everyone's suffering and refusing to learn can't achieve a </i>real<i> Rank-Up!</i>

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.910
Indeed... You are...

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:32.370
Go, Hope Roots! Attack Etheric Amen!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:36.120
Impossible! Attacking my Monster with merely 500 Attack Points?!

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.630
At this moment, I activate Hope Roots' effect!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:47.380
When this card battles an Xyz Monster, by giving one Overlay Unit to the opponent, it can negate its attack,

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:52.930
and during this turn, Hope Roots' Attack Power is the difference between its Rank and the opposing Monster's

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.930
that has its battle negated x 100 points!

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:58.730
The difference between their Ranks is 12! Therefore, its Attack Power becomes 1200!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.770
What can such a low-level power-up possibly accomplish?!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:08.990
I'm not done yet! Hope Roots' Attack Power will also multiply times the number of Overlay Units from your Monster!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:15.580
Etheric Amen has 33 Overlay Units! Therefore, it has 33 times its current Attack Points!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:28.010
39600 Attack Points?! But Hope Roots' battle is already over!

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:33.470
Are you sure?! I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Double-Up Chance!

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:43.440
When a Monster's attack was negated, it can double the Attack Points of the negated Monster and let it battle once again!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:46.400
79200 Attack Points!?

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:53.780
This is the result of the Duel I got by fighting together with Astral! Hope Roots, make the final attack!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:57.540
Hope Sword Roots Slash!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:04.670
This is the new light that will guide this world...!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:20.020
Yuma... Thank you...

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.440
Did I...win?

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:36.490
Yuma, it seems my mission is over.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.950
Eliphas...

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:49.970
Everyone, just like how Yuma shared his power with us, it is now our turn to give power to Yuma!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.810
The light...

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:06.820
Astral World has made a new decision.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:43.060
Astral...

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.060
Yuma...

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:53.990
I can feel it...the beat of your heart...as well as your warmth.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:54.950
You...

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.410
You stupid idiot!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.620
Yuma...?

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:08.630
I won't let go this time! I definitely won't let go this time!

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:15.930
So...don't go anywhere! Don't leave me, Astral!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:20.060
Before us lies...the Barian World.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:24.270
I'm a Barian...? I can't believe I'm a Barian...!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:28.230
Yuma... Astral... Kaito...

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:33.280
I don't know if I can break the bonds I forged with them...!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:37.860
You should go meet them... Our <i>true</i> friends.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:42.540
Everything you have lost lies there.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.380
This place...

00:17:53.380 --> 00:18:01.430
It's Barian World. Take a look behind you, you two. Everyone was waiting for your return.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.730
Your Highness!

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.440
Welcome back, my king.

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:12.900
Your majesty!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.110
You guys...

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:21.120
- Welcome back, our king!
 - You're the best king ever!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:26.120
Barian World is a miraculous space that connects our souls.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.040
Everyone...still remembers me?

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:32.750
The battle between Astral World and Barian World...

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.510
Maybe it will continue until one side is destroyed.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:39.640
At this rate, you will repeat your past experience once again.

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:44.770
Just like that time...

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:48.520
Only you are able to end this battle once and for all.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:53.230
It's my mission...to protect this world.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:59.030
That's right! Even if that means severing your bonds with Yuma and the others!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.950
The battle between the Astral World and the Barian World...

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:18.130
Settling everything in my own way is my fate!

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:24.350
Ryouga... I will follow you anywhere your fate leads you, Ryouga.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:28.810
That's right! You guys are Nasch and Merag!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:32.100
Yuma...

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:37.230
Let's head toward my future!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:40.950
Along with all of you!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:49.120
Yuma... I was always able to hear your voice. You really have pushed your body recklessly.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.120
Hmph, this was nothing.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.330
Thank you.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:56.750
Geez... That's a bit creepy.

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:04.430
It seems the time to enjoy your reunion is no more.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:06.850
Huh?!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.600
Wha...what's that?!

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:18.360
Barian World is awakening a strong power.

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:23.070
Don't tell me that the sealed God of Barian World, Don Thousand was...

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.070
Don Thousand?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:28.830
The opponent I have battled with long ago.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:36.250
Astral. With such strong power, I am afraid it has already imposed some influence on the human world.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:39.760
You guys should return to the human world as soon as possible! I will give this to you!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:45.840
Astral World was revived due to Yuma's power.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:51.890
But to save this world from the Barian World's threats, your mission has not changed.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:57.690
Yuma and I will find the new future for sure!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.900
That's right, we'll find it!

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.990
Now go forth!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.990
Oh! Thanks for everything, Eliphas!

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:21.090
When the crisis that threatens the world approaches,

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:25.720
...the hero that will save the world shall emerge.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:27.840
That is ZEXAL.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:30.260
I am counting on you, Yuma, Astral.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:38.440
That kid changed this world in a heartbeat!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.690
That child has really grown up.

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:44.400
Yeah, and Yuma will grow more and more.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.610
Right. Because that child...

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:53.040
Yuma has chosen us. Go on, Yuma!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:57.870
I have completed...the Numbers!

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:02.420
Vector, the time has come to engulf everything in Chaos!

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:23.730
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:26.280
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.490
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:28.910
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:31.780
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:36.830
